# No em dashes

Do not use the em dash character (`—`, U+2014) anywhere in this project: UI copy, marketing pages, comments, or commit messages.

Prefer:
- a period or new sentence
- a comma or colon
- a hyphen (`-`) for compounds or simple separators
- an en dash (`–`) only for numeric ranges like `2016–2019` when a range is needed

When editing existing text that contains an em dash, replace it with one of the options above.
